    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Where enabled for a deployment, Callcenter can hold multilingual conversations across channels against a single underlying knowledge base: understand the customer’s language, retrieve approved information, respond appropriately, and hand over with translated context. A human adviser might receive an English summary of a conversation that took place in another language. This is not a promise of universal language coverage.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Sensitive data</p>
