    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Callcenter is designed to operate within configurable identity, permission and data-governance boundaries — PII handling, masking, redaction, logs, transcripts, retention, access and tool permissions. We do not claim compliance certifications here.
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
