  </h2>
  <p class="mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
    Subject to retention and data policy, Callcenter can use relevant previous interactions — for example, that this is the customer’s third contact about the same unresolved issue. That can affect prioritisation, escalation, routing and the recommended response. Memory is policy-controlled. It is not indefinite recall.
  </p>
</section>

