    <p class="mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Callcenter is easiest to understand as a set of specialist investigations: identity, intent, conversation state, knowledge, customer context, actions, policy, routing, translation, summary and quality. That is a way of explaining the operating model. It is not a claim that every deployment exposes these roles as named services.
    </p>
