    <p class="mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Voice, WhatsApp, SMS and email enter a universal conversation layer. Identity, intent and orchestration sit above an agent team connected to knowledge, Salesforce, tools, customer data and policies. The path then either resolves or hands off to Teams, Slack, Salesforce or a human adviser — surrounded by identity, permissions, observability, evaluation, audit and guardrails.
